    "updated_at": "2025-01-20T09:01:06Z",
    "body": "Thank you very much for your detailed report!\n\nIn sQUlearn 0.8.0, we integrated support for the Qiskit V2 primitives. To ensure backward compatibility, a version check of Qiskit determines whether the V2 or V1 primitives are used in sQUlearn.\n\nIf you plan to use Qiskit IBM Runtime, please ensure that your Qiskit version is higher than 1.1 (versions 1.2 or 1.3 are recommended). Additionally, the qiskit-ibm-runtime package is currently at version 0.34.0, so an update may be necessary.\n\nThank you for pointing out the issue with PennyLane 0.40.0. We have pushed a fix to the development branch, and it will be included in the next release.\n\nPlease let us now, if there are any issues with the updated version of Qiskit. ",
